<div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12px;">
    <h2>Neue Anfrage über das Formular</h2>

    <p>Sie haben eine neue Anfrage über Ihre Website erhalten:</p>

    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;">
        {% if salutationDisplay %}
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;">Anrede:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{ salutationDisplay }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;">Vorname:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{ firstName }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold;">Nachname:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{ lastName }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold;">E-Mail:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><a href="mailto:{{ email }}">{{ email }}</a></td>
        </tr>
        {% if phone %}
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold;">Telefon:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{ phone }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
        {% if productName %}
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold;">Produkt:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>{{ productName }}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
        {% if description %}
        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: top;">Beschreibung:</td>
            <td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{{ description|nl2br }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endif %}
    </table>

    <p style="color: #666;">Dies ist eine automatische Nachricht von Ihrem Anfrageformular.</p>
</div>

